; Independent board verification of the form-neutral token space and the healed
; learning-curve signal. The shared review flow persists every answer first.
import "../form/form-stdlib/core.fk"
import "review-panel.fk"
import "review-ask.fk"

(ra-review
  "model/form-neutral-token-space.fk"
  "Independent verification only; do not edit any file. Read model/form-neutral-token-space.fk, model/tests/form-neutral-token-space-band.fk, model/form-neutral-language-world-model.fk, model/form-neutral-language-world-model-activation.fk, learn/tests/nl-meaning-net-band.fk, and receipts/2026-07-01-nl-meaning-net-corrected.md. Freshly preflight and run the token-space and learning bands. Verify that language strings remain mapping evidence rather than token identity; NL and PL surfaces converge only through explicit candidate-alignment edges; reverse projection retains anchor/context evidence; a multiword phrase can resolve to one recipe token without claiming universal meme coverage; directed incoming/outgoing query is real; the nested numeric coordinate contains no language surface, reconstructs anchor and recursive recipe tokens exactly, and rejects malformed tags/recipes; the complete token-space envelope stays under the active 16 MiB covenant while the token plane itself is surface-free. Try forged tokens/edges/spaces, missing and duplicate world elements, dangling endpoints, invalid anchor indexes, duplicate or unordered numeric recipe roles, unknown surfaces/locales, recipe tokens with no incoming anchor, and misleading same-recipe projections. Also audit the learning-band change: it must preserve the observed raw 34/26/32/36 curve and replace the statistically invalid monotonicity demand only with the stated every-checkpoint-above-twice-chance floor; it must not claim the learner itself became monotonic. Return PASS AS A BOUNDED CANDIDATE TOKEN/NUMERIC COORDINATE INTEGRATION, REVISE, or BLOCK, naming any executable bypass or prose overclaim. Empty or unfinished output is absence, not a vote.")
